    <node id="&quot;CON ĐƯỜNG NGỌC BÍCH TRÊN BIỂN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A long-standing sea trade route known as the Jade Road; Vietnam joined this maritime trade network that persisted for millennia (roughly 2000 BCE – 1000 CE)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Maritime Silk Road; a long-standing sea-trade route in which Vietnam participated from about 2000 BCE to 1000 CE."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Maritime Silk Road; ancient trade route along which Vietnam participated, sustaining regional commerce for about 3,000 years (2000 BCE–1000 CE)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sea Silk Road; maritime trade route that Vietnam joined, lasting about 3,000 years (2000 TCN–1000 SCN)."</data>
