    <node id="&quot;HỒNG BÀNG&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dynastic era associated with the early rulers of Văn Lang/Âu Lạc; often used to denote the royal lineage."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dynastic name associated with the Văn Lang era within the Đông Sơn cultural framework; represents early political lineage in Vietnamese history."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Hong Bang era, the early dynastic period of Vietnamese history that includes the rise of Văn Lang and the dynastic line.'&lt;SEP&gt;"Legendary Vietnamese ruling dynasty associated with the early Vietnamese polity and the aristocracy under Han-era influence in Nam Việt."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legendary era marking the beginning of the early Vietnamese states; linked with the dynastic line of Kinh Dương Vương, Sùng Lãm, and the Hùng Vương."&lt;SEP&gt;"Era marking the early dynastic period in Vietnamese history, begun by Kinh Dương Vương and linked to the Xích Quỷ state."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hồng Bàng refers to one of the ancient Vietnamese polities mentioned alongside Văn Lang and Âu Lạc in the early history narrative."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hồng Bàng refers to the early royal line associated with the Văn Lang realm, representing legendary dynastic heritage in northern Vietnam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hồng Bàng refers to the early royal line associated with the Văn Lang/Văn Lang realm in northern Vietnam, representing the legendary dynastic heritage of the region."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2c272541ed6794431c00e6ca7ce7f4da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01995274690fe1835d7836e3a481a678&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8643f67e9d45af93e4e82b2745d1580</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PHONG CHÂU&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ancient Vietnamese capital city of Văn Lang during the Hong Bang era."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ancient capital of Văn Lang; political center of the early Vietnamese state."&lt;SEP&gt;"Capital city of Văn Lang."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ancient capital of Văn Lang; administrative center in the Red River Delta region."</data>
