    <node id="&quot;PHONG KHÊ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ancient capital of Âu Lạc after relocation by Thục Phán; part of the kingdom's political history."&lt;SEP&gt;"Phong Khê is the place to which An Dương Vương is said to have moved the capital, indicating a shift in political center.&lt;SEP&gt;"Phong Khê is referenced as the capital location to which An Dương Vương moved during the Âu Lạc period, indicating its political importance in the kingdom's administration."</data>
