      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A notable battle near Tonlé Sap Lake between the Khmer Empire and Cham Pa during the Khmer expansion, associated with Suryavarman II’s campaigns."&lt;SEP&gt;"Battle of Tonlé Sap Lake where Cham forces reportedly defeated Khmer; associated with Suryavarman II's era."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Battle of Tonlé Sap, where Cham forces defeated Khmer troops near Tonlé Sap."&lt;SEP&gt;"A significant battle near Tonlé Sap during Khmer–Cham campaigns."&lt;SEP&gt;"Trận chiến diễn ra trên Hồ Tonlé Sap trong cuộc tấn công năm 1177 của Cham Pa nhằm vào Angkor."</data>
