    <node id="&quot;SRIVIJAYA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Srivijaya was a maritime kingdom in Sumatra that interacted with Tang China and broader Southeast Asian networks."&lt;SEP&gt;"Srivijaya, a maritime empire in Southeast Asia, part of the broader regional trading network."&lt;SEP&gt;"Srivijaya, an ancient maritime empire in Southeast Asia, referenced as a major regional polity and cultural touchstone in the broader historical context."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vương quốc Srivijaya, đế chế hàng hải cổ ở Đông Nam Á được nhắc đến trong bối cảnh giao thương khu vực."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-3369f1880c271bd6eae21c84158803a3</data>
    </node>
