    <node id="&quot;LÊ THÁNH TÔNG&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Emperor Lê Thánh Tông, who expanded Đại Việt and conducted campaigns against Champa and Ai Lao."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lê Thánh Tông was a Vietnamese emperor of the Lê dynasty whose death in 1497 precipitated a period of political decline in Đại Việt, marked by rapid monarchic turnover and economic and social difficulties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lê Thánh Tông was a Vietnamese emperor who ruled Đại Việt; his death in 1497 marked the beginning of a period of decline characterized by economic hardship, natural calamities, and peasant uprisings across the realm."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lê Thánh Tông was a Vietnamese king of the Lê dynasty who ruled Đại Việt; his death around 1497 led Đại Việt into a period of decline marked by economic exhaustion, famine, and uprisings throughout the kingdom."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lê Thánh Tông was a Vietnamese monarch of the Lê dynasty who reigned during the late 15th century in Đại Việt and is noted in this context as the ruler deposed in the Mạc usurpation that followed his reign."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lý Thánh Tông was the third emperor of the Lý dynasty; he changed the country’s name to Đại Việt and oversaw major state-building including dyke construction, founding Quốc Tử Giám, and the Tam khoa imperial exams."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lý Thánh Tông was the third emperor of the Lý dynasty; under his reign the country’s name was changed to Đại Việt and state institutions continued to expand and solidify."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lý Thánh Tông, the third emperor of the Lý dynasty; renamed Đại Cồ Việt to Đại Việt and implemented major reforms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vietnamese emperor of the Lê dynasty who expanded territory through campaigns against Champa, including capturing Vijaya."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vietnamese emperor of the Lê dynasty who expanded Đại Việt's territory and conducted campaigns against Champa and neighboring regions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vietnamese emperor who expanded Đại Việt's territory, conducted campaigns against Champa, and laid groundwork for southern expansion."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vietnamese revolutionary and member of the National Uprising Committee, aiding coordination of the uprising."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vua thứ ba của triều Lý; đã đổi quốc hiệu thành Đại Việt và có nhiều đóng góp về chính sách, giáo dục và xây dựng đất nước."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-277e0e3e66eb14031c1d448dfa63e42c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bfa206adeee22a1ede2ef2ae0ad9711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-561d10717f3ff788e1032021a4cf0614&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dab4a6d06213a3107d9e1ca29469f707</data>
    </node>
