      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A major city in California, United States; referenced as the location of the Bảo tàng Nghệ thuật Quận Los Angeles in the document."&lt;SEP&gt;"City in California, USA; listed as the publication location for Edward Schafer's The Vermilion Bird."&lt;SEP&gt;"City in California, USA; publication location listed for The Vermilion Bird (Edward Schafer)."&lt;SEP&gt;"City in California, United States; location associated with the art museum mentioned in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"City in California, United States; mentioned as the location of a referenced art museum caption."&lt;SEP&gt;"Los Angeles is listed as the location for publication of The Vermilion Bird."&lt;SEP&gt;"Los Angeles is the city referenced as the location of the Bảo tàng Nghệ thuật Quận Los Angeles in the Vietnamese text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Los Angeles is the location listed in The Vermilion Bird by Edward Hetzel Schafer (1967) with University of California Press."&lt;SEP&gt;"City in California; mentioned as the location of the Los Angeles County Museum of Art in the artifact captions."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1095d21a9a487ebf90afcd96d02737d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-561d10717f3ff788e1032021a4cf0614&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec018c17c8753decfbcce379313be41b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NEW YORK&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"City in the USA; publication addresses referenced for Cambridge University Press publications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Location used in publication addresses for Cambridge University Press publications (e.g., The Cambridge History of China 1)."&lt;SEP&gt;"New York is the city that hosts The Metropolitan Museum of Art mentioned in association with the Bảo tàng Nghệ thuật Metropolitan."&lt;SEP&gt;"New York is the location cited for a work in Cambridge University Press publication context."&lt;SEP&gt;"New York is the location listed in Cambridge University Press citations (publisher location)."</data>
