    <node id="&quot;TRƯƠNG ĐỊNH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Trương Định was a Vietnamese general and resistance leader against French expansion, associated with Can Vuong and southern uprisings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Trương Định was a leading figure in the Vietnamese Cần Vương resistance against French rule."&lt;SEP&gt;"Trương Định was a Vietnamese leader involved in anti-French resistance, noted among local aristocrats who led various anti-colonial movements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Trương Định was a Vietnamese revolutionary leader associated with resistance against French conquest and the broader Cần Vương movement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Trương Định was a notable Vietnamese leader associated with anti-French resistance alongside other officials in central Vietnam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Trương Định was a Vietnamese resistance leader later associated with anti-French efforts against colonial expansion."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vietnamese resistance leader involved in anti-colonial actions."</data>
