      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Central Vietnamese leader who led the Hương Khê uprising in the central region."&lt;SEP&gt;"Phan Đình Phùng was a prominent Vietnamese leader in the Cần Vương resistance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Phan Đình Phùng was a prominent Vietnamese patriot and leader within the Cần Vương resistance against French colonization."&lt;SEP&gt;"Phan Đình Phùng was a key leader of the Hương Khê uprising in central Vietnam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Phan Đình Phùng was a Vietnamese resistance leader known for opposing French incursions in the South and Central regions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Central Vietnamese rebel leader who led the Hương Khê uprising."</data>
