    <node id="&quot;NGUYỄN TRUNG TRỰC&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Nguyễn Trung Trực led guerrilla actions against French incursions and notably attacked French forces in the southern/central regions.&lt;SEP&gt;"Nguyễn Trung Trực led guerrilla actions in southern Vietnam, including attacking the French ship L'Espérance as a symbol of resistance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nguyễn Trung Trực was a prominent leader in the southern anti-French Can Vuong resistance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nguyễn Trung Trực was a Vietnamese rebel leader linked to Can Vuong efforts against French forces."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nguyễn Trung Trực led guerrilla actions and is credited with sinking the French ship L'Éspérance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nguyễn Trung Trực was a Vietnamese resistance figure active in anti-French campaigns in the southern provinces."&lt;SEP&gt;"Southern Vietnamese guerrilla leader who fought French forces."</data>
