      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A resistance movement against French colonial rule aiming to restore centralized Nguyễn authority."&lt;SEP&gt;"Phong trào Cần Vương was a broad Vietnamese resistance movement against French colonial expansion, mobilizing uprisings across regions."&lt;SEP&gt;"A royalist Vietnamese uprising in the late 19th century opposing French colonial rule and the reform policies of the Nguyễn dynasty."</data>
