      <data key="d1">"French colonial infantry unit known for distinctive uniforms; actively engaged in Vietnam campaigns, including assaults on Saigon during the early colonial period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Zouave soldiers, a French military unit, participated in the Vietnam campaigns, including actions around Saigon and Da Nang."</data>
