      <data key="d2">chunk-c3e2d86a8a15344ff5c25829117f928c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HIỆP ƯỚC SÀI GÒN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The 1862 Saigon Treaty between the Nguyễn court and France (and Spain) ceded territory and established French influence in southern Vietnam, notably around Gia Định/Sài Gòn."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 1862 treaty signed in Saigon between the Huế court and France and Spain, expanding French influence in the region."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Treaty of Saigon negotiated in the Nguyễn court era with France (and Spain) around 1862, marking cession and French influence over southern territories."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c3e2d86a8a15344ff5c25829117f928c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HIỆP ƯỚC QUÝ MÙI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The 1883 Treaty of Quý Mùi formalized French dominance over Vietnam, marking a decisive step in the colonial consolidation under the Nguyễn dynasty.&lt;SEP&gt;"The 1883 treaty that established the French protectorate over Vietnam and marked a major expansion of colonial rule."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Quý Mùi Treaty of 1883, defining French colonial control and the status of Vietnam under the Nguyễn court."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c3e2d86a8a15344ff5c25829117f928c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HIỆP ƯỚC PATENÔTRE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A treaty whose effect was officially terminated by the Élysée accord."&lt;SEP&gt;"An 1884 treaty whose effects were formally ended or superseded during the decolonization period around 1950."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 1884 treaty reaffirming the French protectorate and regularizing the Indochina settlement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 1884 Patenôtre Treaty reaffirmed French protectorate arrangements in Vietnam within Indochina.&lt;SEP&gt;"Pre-1949 treaty whose force was effectively superseded or rendered obsolete by later arrangements in Indochina."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Patenôtre Treaty of 1884 reaffirming French control and the Indochina framework."&lt;SEP&gt;"An 1884 treaty whose authority was effectively superseded by later agreements during the transition period in Indochina."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4ebc4b0a454e2ea3adc019759de704c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3e2d86a8a15344ff5c25829117f928c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PHONG TRÀO VĂN THÂN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Vietnamese resistance/movement (Phong trào Văn Thân) involved in anti-French activities and linked to broader nationalist efforts."&lt;SEP&gt;"A late 19th-century Vietnamese reform and patriotic movement that contributed to uprisings; its Nghĩa quân wing carried out actions against colonial forces."&lt;SEP&gt;"A literati-led nationalist movement in Vietnam that played a role in anti-French resistance and promoted cultural and political modernization."&lt;SEP&gt;"A literati-led reform and nationalist movement opposing French rule and advocating traditional social order with modernization."&lt;SEP&gt;"A nationalist anti-French movement that persisted in resistance against colonial rule."&lt;SEP&gt;"A traditional scholarly reform and resistance movement in Vietnam linked to Nghĩa quân as part of anti-colonial activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Văn Thân movement, with its Nghĩa quân, contributed to late 19th-century anti-French resistance in Vietnam."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-3bcac0a2ed12c8c14d19b01dcb829b2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3e2d86a8a15344ff5c25829117f928c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NGHĨA QUÂN YÊN THẾ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A guerrilla movement led by Đề Thám (Hoàng Hoa Thám) in Yen The region against French rule."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Yen The Nghia Quan uprising, led by Đề Thám (Hoàng Hoa Thám), resisted French colonial forces in the northern region."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Yên Thế guerrilla army led by Đề Thám, resisting French rule until 1911."&lt;SEP&gt;"Guerrilla movement in the north led by Hoàng Hoa Thám against French rule, active until 1911."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c3e2d86a8a15344ff5c25829117f928c</data>
    </node>
