      <data key="d1">"Hoàng Hoa Thám, also known as Đề Thám, commander of the Nghĩa quân Yên Thế."&lt;SEP&gt;"North Vietnamese guerrilla leader who commanded Nghĩa quân Yên Thế against the French."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c3e2d86a8a15344ff5c25829117f928c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ĐỀ THÁM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Hoàng Hoa Thám, also known as Đề Thám, the prominent guerilla leader who commanded Nghĩa quân in Yen The uprising."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hoàng Hoa Thám, commonly known as Đề Thám; leader of Nghĩa quân Yên Thế."&lt;SEP&gt;"Đề Thám (Hoàng Hoa Thám) led the Nghĩa quân in Yên Thế and commanded local resistance against French expansion in the north."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c3e2d86a8a15344ff5c25829117f928c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HÀM NGHI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Emperor Hàm Nghi of the Nguyễn dynasty who issued the Can Vuong edict urging resistance against French rule."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hàm Nghi was the young Nguyễn emperor who issued the Can Vuong decree calling for nationwide resistance against French domination."&lt;SEP&gt;"The young Nguyễn dynasty emperor who fled Huế and issued the Can Vuong edict."&lt;SEP&gt;"Young Nguyễn emperor who proclaimed Can Vuong in 1885 and was later exiled to Algeria."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c3e2d86a8a15344ff5c25829117f928c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TÔN THẤT THUYẾT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Senior official who supported Can Vuong and accompanied Hàm Nghi in Hue."&lt;SEP&gt;"Senior royal official who co-authored the Can Vuong edict with Hàm Nghi."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tôn Thất Thuyết was a high Nguyễn official who co-authored the Can Vuong decree and supported anti-French efforts at the Huế court."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tôn Thất Thuyết was a senior Nguyễn court official who supported national resistance against French colonial efforts."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c3e2d86a8a15344ff5c25829117f928c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHIẾU CẦN VƯƠNG&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Chiếu Cần Vương (Can Vuong decree) was issued to mobilize nationwide resistance against French rule in Vietnam."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Can Vuong edict urging the Vietnamese population to rise against French occupation.&lt;SEP&gt;"The Can Vuong edict issued by Emperor Hàm Nghi calling the Vietnamese to defend the country."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c3e2d86a8a15344ff5c25829117f928c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CỜ ĐEN&quot;">
