      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Alias of Phan Bội Châu used in writings; a pen name representing his revolutionary persona."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pseudonym used by Phan Bội Châu in his writings and public life."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sào Nam is a pen name used by Phan Bội Châu; a revolutionary figure whose writings and leadership informed the Vietnamese independence movement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The pseudonym of Phan Bội Châu; his writings were included in Đông Kinh Nghĩa Thục's educational materials."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-3bcac0a2ed12c8c14d19b01dcb829b2f</data>
