    <node id="&quot;KHANG HỮU VI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Chinese-origin writer whose Modern Western texts (Dai Dong Thu) were translated and used in Đông Kinh Nghĩa Thục's curriculum."&lt;SEP&gt;"Figure who translated modern works (e.g., Đại đồng thư) used at Đông Kinh Nghĩa Thục."&lt;SEP&gt;"Khang Hữu Vi was a reformist author whose work Đại đồng thư was translated and used at Đông Kinh Nghĩa Thục as part of modernizing curriculum."&lt;SEP&gt;"Khang Hữu Vi was a reformist scholar whose work Đại đồng thư was translated and used in the Đông Kinh Nghĩa Thục curriculum, illustrating cross-cultural exchange and modernization."&lt;SEP&gt;"Khang Hữu Vi is a Chinese reformist scholar whose work Đại đồng thư was used as modern texts at Đông Kinh Nghĩa Thục to promote modernization of Vietnamese education."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-3bcac0a2ed12c8c14d19b01dcb829b2f</data>
    </node>
