      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Chinese reformist whose works were translated for use in Đông Kinh Nghĩa Thục to modernize education."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lương Khải Siêu was a Chinese reformist whose work Ẩm Băng thất tùng thư was translated and incorporated into the school's educational materials at Đông Kinh Nghĩa Thục."&lt;SEP&gt;"Reformist who produced or translated modern literature (e.g., Ẩm Băng thất tùng thư) used at the school."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chinese reformist author whose works were used as modern texts in Vietnamese education (e.g., Đại đồng thư) to modernize thought."</data>
