      <data key="d1">"Africa, the continent to which Thành Thái and Duy Tân were exiled by the French for anti-colonial actions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Continental Africa; exile destination for deposed emperors Thành Thái and Duy Tân due to anti-French sentiments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Africa, where deposed kings Thành Thái and Duy Tân were exiled by French authorities."</data>
