      <data key="d1">"Ba Đình Square (Ba Đình), in Hanoi, was the large public square selected as the site for the Tuyên ngôn Độc lập reading and mass gathering surrounding the nation's declaration."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ba Đình Square in Hanoi, the site where the Declaration of Independence was read in 1945."</data>
