      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Vietnamese leader who returned from France and played a central role in the independence movement and the VNDCH government."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chairman Ho Chi Minh, a pivotal Vietnamese revolutionary leader who returns from France and leads the independence movement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chủ tịch Hồ Chí Minh, a central figure in Vietnamese independence and leadership during the transition from colonial rule to the early Republic."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ho Chi Minh, the leading Vietnamese revolutionary and political figure who played a central role in the independence movement and governance around 1946."&lt;SEP&gt;"Leader of the Vietnamese independence movement who read the Declaration of Independence on September 2, 1945.&lt;SEP&gt;"Chủ tịch Hồ Chí Minh, a central figure in the Vietnamese struggle for independence, who proclaims independence and calls for national unity and support for the new government."</data>
