    <node id="&quot;QUÂN ĐỘI PHÁP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"French Army; provided military force for France in Indochina, fighting Việt Minh and supporting allied colonial operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Quân đội Hoa Kỳ, lực lượng quân sự nước ngoài hỗ trợ VNCH trong Chiến tranh Việt Nam."&lt;SEP&gt;"The French Army active in Indochina, conducting military operations against Việt Minh and supporting French colonial efforts."&lt;SEP&gt;"The French Army in Indochina, which withdrew from southern Vietnam by 1956 under American pressure, marking the end of large-scale French control."&lt;SEP&gt;"The French Expeditionary Forces in Indochina, the military arm of France engaged in the struggle against Việt Minh."&lt;SEP&gt;"The French army in Saigon, which included Vietnamese troops; the text notes many Vietnamese soldiers (15,000) in this army, forming part of the occupation forces."&lt;SEP&gt;"The French military forces operating in Indochina against Việt Minh."&lt;SEP&gt;"The United States Armed Forces referenced in the text as the military backing of South Vietnam during the war."</data>
