      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An anti-communist compromise strategy associated with Bảo Đại.&lt;SEP&gt;"Bao Dai's proposed compromise with France to guide anti-communist policy and cooperation with French authorities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bảo Đại-backed political settlement proposed by anti-Communist Vietnamese factions during the Nam Kinh alignment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Giải pháp Bảo Đại là liên minh chống cộng của người Việt ở Nam Kinh năm 1947, ủng hộ hợp tác với Pháp nhằm đối phó Việt Minh."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4ebc4b0a454e2ea3adc019759de704c4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MAO TRẠCH ĐÔNG&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Leader of the Chinese Communist Party who led China after 1949 and supported allied movements including Vietnam through aid and diplomacy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Leader of the People's Republic of China; his victory in 1949 and leadership supported North Vietnam; exerted influence on regional communist movements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mao Zedong, leader of the Chinese Communist Party and pivotal figure in establishing the PRC in 1949; his leadership affected regional alignments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mao Zedong, Chinese Communist leader who led the founding of the People's Republic of China and supported Vietnamese communists."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mao Zedong, leader of the Chinese Communist Party who established the People's Republic of China in 1949 and influenced regional dynamics."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c715893072e90e3f1536ec249629f939</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NGÔ ĐÌNH DIỆM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ngô Đình Diệm was the leader of the Republic of Vietnam (South Vietnam) government, known for harsh suppression of political and religious opponents in the South."&lt;SEP&gt;"Prime Minister who became President of Việt Nam Cộng hòa after Bao Đại's ouster in 1955; led the southern regime."&lt;SEP&gt;"South Vietnamese political leader who deposed Bao Dai and became the first president of the Republic of Vietnam, consolidating the VNCH."&lt;SEP&gt;"South Vietnamese president who violently suppressed opposition and led VNCH."&lt;SEP&gt;"South Vietnamese leader who led the coup against Bảo Đại (1955) and established the Việt Nam Cộng hòa; became president of VNCH."&lt;SEP&gt;"South Vietnamese prime minister who ousted Bảo Đại and established the Republic of Vietnam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Prime Minister, later President, of Việt Nam Cộng hòa; orchestrated the 1955 coup that deposed Bảo Đại and renamed the southern state."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c715893072e90e3f1536ec249629f939&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4549a0a33a97f39084dfcd2d857e18f8</data>
    </node>
