      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Chiến dịch migration campaign during 1954 linked to Geneva Accords that spurred large-scale north-to-south movement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Migration/Crossing operation following the partition, moving people from North to South Vietnam."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Road to Freedom migration campaign in 1954, leading to a mass exodus of North Vietnamese to the South."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c715893072e90e3f1536ec249629f939</data>
    </node>
