      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mass migration (roughly 1 million people) from North to South Vietnam following partition under Geneva Accords."&lt;SEP&gt;"Migration episode triggered by the Geneva Accords, with many northern civilians relocating to the South."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vietnamese Migration (1954): mass movement of nearly a million people from North to South, with affected civilians and Viet Minh personnel relocating."&lt;SEP&gt;"Migration from the North to the South following the Geneva Accords, involving roughly one million people and reshaping the demographic map."</data>
