    <node id="&quot;HIỆP ĐỊNH GENÈVE 1954&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Geneva Accords (1954) between Việt Nam Dân chủ Cộng hòa and France; temporarily dividing Vietnam at the 17th parallel."&lt;SEP&gt;"Geneva Accords (1954) that temporarily partitioned Vietnam at the 17th parallel and allowed migration between the two zones."&lt;SEP&gt;"Geneva Accords (1954); agreement that temporarily partitioned Vietnam at the 17th parallel and outlined elections and migration."&lt;SEP&gt;"Geneva Accords signed in 1954 between Vietnam's Viet Minh and France, temporarily dividing Vietnam at the 17th parallel."&lt;SEP&gt;"Geneva Conference Accords of 1954, partitioning Vietnam and setting terms for elections and unification."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Geneva Agreements (1954) signed between the DRV and France, temporarily dividing Vietnam at the 17th parallel and setting terms including refugee migration and canceling elections."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4549a0a33a97f39084dfcd2d857e18f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c715893072e90e3f1536ec249629f939</data>
