    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LÊ DUẨN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"General Secretary of the Communist Party of Vietnam; led policy decisions after reunification."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lê Duẩn was the General Secretary of the Communist Party of Vietnam and a central political leader during the reunification period and early postwar era."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lê Duẩn, a prominent communist leader, was arrested in Saigon during the crackdown on the uprising."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lê Duẩn was among the leaders arrested in Saigon during the crackdown on the Nam Kỳ uprising.&lt;SEP&gt;"Lê Duẩn, General Secretary of the Communist Party of Vietnam, who led the country’s governance and policy after the war."&lt;SEP&gt;"General Secretary of the Communist Party of Vietnam; led policy decisions during the postwar period and the approach to reunification and consolidation.&lt;SEP&gt;"Senior member of the Indochina Communist Party; arrested in Saigon in 1940 along with other leaders during a crackdown."</data>
