    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ANGKOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Angkor was the central seat of the Khmer Empire, a major power in the Cham–Khmer conflicts, near Tonlé Sap."&lt;SEP&gt;"Capital of the Khmer Empire, also known as Yasodharapura."&lt;SEP&gt;"The capital of the Khmer Empire; the center of military campaigns against Cham Pa and the broader Khmer–Champa conflicts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tên khác của kinh đô Khmer, Yasodharapura."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-3369f1880c271bd6eae21c84158803a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bc2794dad524831d7084c6c23b70cd1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;YASODHARAPURA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Kinh đô của Khmer Empire, còn được gọi là Angkor."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Khmer capital, Angkor; alternative name used for Angkor during this era."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yasodharapura, the Khmer Empire's capital city, identified in the text as Angkor's historic name and focal point of Khmer campaigns against Cham Pa."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-3369f1880c271bd6eae21c84158803a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bc2794dad524831d7084c6c23b70cd1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CÔN MINH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Côn Minh (Kunming); a gateway on the land route connecting An Nam to southern China via Yunnan and Chengdu."&lt;SEP&gt;"Kunming; a key inland hub connected by river and land routes to An Nam’s trade network."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-cc782d7f1eac567ce6188dd679cd4c53</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ĐÔ HỘ AN NAM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An Nam đô hộ phủ; the Tang Dynasty’s protectorate administration governing An Nam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tang-era provincial governorate overseeing An Nam, responsible for administration, including tax increases."&lt;SEP&gt;"Đô hộ An Nam refers to the Tang protectorate administration governing An Nam during various uprisings."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-cc782d7f1eac567ce6188dd679cd4c53</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ĐINH KIẾN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A rebel leader who rose against Tang rule; his leadership was ended when Tào Huyền Tĩnh's forces defeated the revolt and executed him."&lt;SEP&gt;"Đinh Kiến was the rebel leader who rose after Lý Tự Tiên and was subsequently defeated and executed by Tang general Tào Huyền Tĩnh."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-cc782d7f1eac567ce6188dd679cd4c53</data>
    </node>
