      <data key="d1">"Leader of uprisings in the north; commanded by Phùng Lâm; rebels described as self-styled 'Nam Việt Hoàng đế' at times."&lt;SEP&gt;"Trần Hành Phạm is a rebel leader who, along with Phùng Lâm, led uprisings in the Bắc Việt region against Tang rule in the 7th–8th centuries."&lt;SEP&gt;"Northern resistance leader who allied with Phùng Lâm."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-cc782d7f1eac567ce6188dd679cd4c53</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PHÙNG LÂM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Co-leader of northern uprisings; together with Trần Hành Phạm he led anti-Dương campaigns."&lt;SEP&gt;"Northern leader who, with Trần Hành Phạm, participated in resistance against central authority."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-cc782d7f1eac567ce6188dd679cd4c53</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DƯƠNG THANH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dương Thanh was a Tang general who captured Tống Bình and killed the Tang protectorate governor, re-establishing Tang control in the area."&lt;SEP&gt;"General who captured Tống Bình and killed the Tang protectorate governor (đô hộ)."&lt;SEP&gt;"General who seized Tống Bình in 820 and killed the governor; later killed by locals in retaliation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-cc782d7f1eac567ce6188dd679cd4c53</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LOẠN AN SỬ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A major rebellion in 755 that affected Tang control in the region and the governance of An Nam."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-cc782d7f1eac567ce6188dd679cd4c53</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ĐẾ CHẾ ĐƯỜNG&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tang Dynasty, a Chinese imperial regime that expanded its authority and established dominance over northern Vietnam, including incursions into Lâm Ấp."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Tang Dynasty, the Chinese imperial regime that controlled An Nam and conducted campaigns in the region."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Tang Dynasty; Chinese imperial authority that administered An Nam and later reconquered it."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-cc782d7f1eac567ce6188dd679cd4c53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bc2794dad524831d7084c6c23b70cd1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BIẾN ĐỘNG AN NAM 858-864&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Period of significant upheaval and instability in An Nam under Tang administration (858–864), creating opportunities for intervention by Nam Chiếu and reshaping regional governance."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-cc782d7f1eac567ce6188dd679cd4c53</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HẬU LƯƠNG&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Hậu Lương was a Chinese dynastic polity that Vietnamese rulers paid tribute to in the early period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hậu Lương was a dynasty in the broader regional order to which Đại Việt paid tribute; part of the period's political landscape."&lt;SEP&gt;"Later Liang dynasty in China; Tĩnh Hải quân paid tribute to secure recognition from this regime."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-6033ac15f370150074084b2248ba04f3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRIỀU TRẦN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Trần dynasty followed the Lý and defended Vietnam against Mongol invasions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Trần dynasty that followed the Lý and challenged invasions from the Mongol–Yuan empire."&lt;SEP&gt;"Trần dynasty; followed the Lý era and defended the realm, notably against Mongol invasions."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-6033ac15f370150074084b2248ba04f3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SÔNG BẠCH ĐẰNG&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Bach Dang River, site of the pivotal 938 battle between Ngô Quyền's forces and Nam Hán."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Bach Dang River; site of the 938 naval battle."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Bạch Đằng River, the site of the famous naval battle in 938."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-6033ac15f370150074084b2248ba04f3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHI LĂNG&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Chi Lăng Pass, Thanh Hóa, a strategic site where Liễu Thăng was killed."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chi Lăng Pass, the site of Lê Hoàn's ambush that repelled the Song invasion in 981."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chi Lăng is referenced as the battlefield where the decisive ambush against Hầu Nhân Bảo occurred."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chi Lăng, the strategic pass where Lê Hoàn lured and defeated Hầu Nhân Bảo during the defense against the Song invasion (981)."</data>
