    <node id="&quot;KHMER EMPIRE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A major Southeast Asian empire centered at Angkor, engaged in regional wars with Champa and expansion across the Mekong region."&lt;SEP&gt;"Khmer Empire was a regional power allied with Chăm Pa in campaigns against Đại Việt."</data>
