      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bắc Sơn uprising is cited as a model for the Nam Kỳ uprising, reflecting continuity in anti-colonial resistance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bắc Sơn uprising served as a historical precedent inspiring later uprisings like Nam Kỳ khởi nghĩa."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bắc Sơn uprising, a historical anti-colonial uprising that served as a model or inspiration for later anti-French and anti-Japanese movements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Bắc Sơn uprising served as a precedent and inspiration for the Nam Kỳ uprising within the broader Vietnamese revolutionary history."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Hương Khê uprising in central Vietnam led by Phan Đình Phùng, continuing until 1896."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lam Sơn uprising, a major rebellion led by Lê Lợi against Ming rule in Đại Việt, beginning in 1418 and culminating in Vietnamese independence."</data>
