      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A major peasant uprising in Quy Nhơn in 1771 that evolved into a broader Tây Sơn movement (1778–1802)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Phong trào Tây Sơn was a peasant uprising (1778–1802) that began in Quy Nhơn and was led by Nguyễn Nhạc, Nguyễn Lữ, and Nguyễn Huệ."&lt;SEP&gt;"Popular uprising in Vietnam (1771–1773) led by Nguyễn Nhạc, Nguyễn Lữ, and Nguyễn Huệ; began in Quy Nhơn."</data>
