    <node id="&quot;NGHĨA QUÂN TÂY SƠN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A militia associated with the Văn Thân and Cần Vương movements, active in anti-French resistance and tied to violence against Catholic communities in Vietnam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Armed rebels affiliated with the Văn Thân and Cần Vương movements, involved in violent resistance during the anti-French struggle in Vietnam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lam Sơn insurgent army led by Lê Lợi, organized to resist Ming occupation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nghĩa quân Cần Vương was a major guerrilla movement within the Can Vuong resistance against French rule."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nghĩa quân Tây Sơn là phong trào quân sự ở miền Trung và Nam Việt Nam, do các nhân vật Tây Sơn lãnh đạo, ban đầu nhằm chống chúa Nguyễn và sau đó mở rộng kiểm soát lãnh thổ."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nghĩa quân refers to peasant- and local-led guerrilla forces that fought French colonial forces, including branches like Nghĩa quân in Yen The and other rural uprisings.&lt;SEP&gt;"The Righteous Army, a guerrilla/insurgent faction associated with the Văn Thân and Cần Vương movements that fought against French rule and Catholic influence in Vietnam."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Tây Sơn peasant-military rebellion force that mobilized peasants, artisans, religious communities, ethnic minorities in the Tây Nguyên region, and Chinese merchants, forming the core military-power behind the Tây Sơn-led upheavals against the Nguyễn lords."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2ca8856a3c05c7e29106b40dae03794b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bcac0a2ed12c8c14d19b01dcb829b2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-561d10717f3ff788e1032021a4cf0614&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3e2d86a8a15344ff5c25829117f928c</data>
    </node>
