      <data key="d1">"A French warship named L'Éspérance, which was sunk during anti-French actions by Nghĩa quân."&lt;SEP&gt;"L'Espérance is a French naval warship that was sunk by Nguyễn Trung Trực's guerrilla forces during the resistance to French colonial expansion in southern Vietnam."&lt;SEP&gt;"L'Espérance is a French warship that was attacked and sunk by Vietnamese guerrilla forces during the anti-French resistance in southern Vietnam."&lt;SEP&gt;"The French warship L'Espérance, attacked by Nguyễn Trung Trực's forces, representing a pivotal naval engagement in Cochinchina during the anti-colonial struggle."</data>
