    <node id="&quot;NGUYỄN DYNASTY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Nguyễn dynasty is the ruling imperial dynasty of Vietnam during the late 19th and early 20th centuries; emperors Thành Thái and Duy Tân belonged to it and opposed French rule."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Nguyễn dynasty was the Vietnamese royal dynasty that ruled during this period and engaged in treaties with France; it faced loss of sovereignty leading to colonial control."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nguyễn dynasty; the ruling Vietnamese dynasty that unified the country toward the 19th century."</data>
