      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"VNQDĐ founded in 1927 following the Kuomintang model; launched the Yen Bai uprising in 1930; leaders were suppressed by the French."&lt;SEP&gt;"VNQDĐ, a Vietnamese nationalist party founded in 1927, modeled after China's Kuomintang and advocating anti-colonial, nationalist programs."&lt;SEP&gt;"VNQDĐ, founded in 1927, modeled on China's Kuomintang; organized the Yen Bai uprising in 1930."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vietnamese nationalist party formed in 1927 modeled on China's Kuomintang; led by Nguyễn Thái Học and known for the Yên Bái uprising (1930)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Việt Nam Quốc Dân Đảng (VNQDĐ), founded in 1927 and modeled after China's Kuomintang; it launched the Yen Bai Uprising in 1930."&lt;SEP&gt;"Việt Nam Quốc dân đảng is one of the political groups that allied with the coalition forming the National Front in the South."</data>
