    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NGA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Russia, a center of revolutionary thought and a context for broader 20th-century socialist movements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Russia, the country whose 1917 revolution and the Soviet era influenced international communist networks including Vietnamese groups via the Comintern."&lt;SEP&gt;"Russia; the Soviet Union; a major geopolitical power whose 1917 revolution and subsequent era provided ideological influence and organizational models for international communist movements, including Vietnamese revolutionary groups via the Comintern."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b60881720494b2801d1866f2d58b8eb9</data>
