      <data key="d1">"A prominent member of the Indochinese Communist Party who was executed in the crackdown."&lt;SEP&gt;"A prominent member of the Indochinese Communist movement who was executed during the crackdown."&lt;SEP&gt;"A significant leader of the Indochinese Communist movement who was executed in the crackdown."&lt;SEP&gt;"A senior cadre of the Indochinese Communist Party; among those executed in the crackdown on the Nam Kỳ khởi nghĩa."</data>
