    <node id="&quot;XÔ VIẾT NGHỆ TĨNH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Soviet-style government entity in Nghệ Tĩnh region referenced as part of the revolutionary movement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soviet-style local governance formed as part of the Indochinese revolutionary movement in Nghệ Tĩnh."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Soviet-style peasant–worker movement formed in Nghệ An and Hà Tĩnh in 1930, establishing soviet-like local governments and confiscating land, grain, and wealth from landlords and factory/ship owners to benefit workers and peasants."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nghệ Tĩnh Soviet, a local revolutionary governance structure and symbol of peasant-led resistance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Xô Viết Nghệ Tĩnh movement; also used as the title of a painting described in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Xô Viết Nghệ Tĩnh was the workers' and peasants' revolutionary movement in Nghệ An and Hà Tĩnh during 1930–1931, which established early revolutionary administrations at local levels (called 'Xô viết') and mobilized mass protests against colonial rule."&lt;SEP&gt;"A historical movement associated with the Nghệ Tĩnh region."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Nghệ Tĩnh Soviet, a regional peasant-revolutionary council in Nghệ Tĩnh reflecting local self-governance within the anti-colonial struggle."&lt;SEP&gt;"Xô Viết Nghệ Tĩnh is the workers' and peasants' revolutionary movement in Nghệ An and Hà Tĩnh during the 1930–1931 revolutionary period, associated with the formation of early grassroots Soviet-style local administrations (Xô viết) in the bases."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-fd3c75fb34fd08ca28a6bdea4defc0f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e0d2b12d6dc3ace3b2354166252a164&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0468eaa8e1dded2ae27a39363308b486&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa6f1c379fafd63c9e5491579d159fc0</data>
    </node>
