      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A guerrilla unit from Bắc Sơn area that participated in anti-French resistance within the broader independence movement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A guerrilla unit that participated in the Bắc Sơn uprising against French forces."&lt;SEP&gt;"A guerrilla unit that participated in the Bắc Sơn uprising."&lt;SEP&gt;"Guerrilla unit that conducted anti-French operations as part of the broader insurgency."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7e0d2b12d6dc3ace3b2354166252a164</data>
