    <node id="&quot;VÕ NGUYÊN GIÁP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A prominent Vietnamese general who personally commanded the Viet Nam Tuyên truyền Giải phóng quân's operations at Phai Khắt and Nà Ngần during December 1944."&lt;SEP&gt;"Minister of Internal Affairs who introduces Hồ Chí Minh on the podium and later becomes a prominent Việt Minh military leader."&lt;SEP&gt;"Renowned Vietnamese general who served on the National Uprising Committee and led operations against Japanese forces in 1945."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vietnamese general whose memoirs and other military documents describe the Phai Khắt and Nà Ngần battles and provide casualty and outcome details."&lt;SEP&gt;"Võ Nguyên Giáp is the Vietnamese general who personally commanded the operations against Phai Khắt and Nà Ngần during the December 1944 battles, leading the Viet Nam Tuyên truyền Giải phóng quân.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7418e6f1b899c505272caee02f3cf1ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0858721f576cf19954031c342a7d2bff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bfa206adeee22a1ede2ef2ae0ad9711</data>
    </node>
