      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A French fort commander at Phai Khắt who rode back to the fort with soldiers during the attack on Phai Khắt."&lt;SEP&gt;"Simono is the French fort commander at Phai Khắt, leading about twenty French soldiers at the Phai Khắt outpost and was killed during the assault.&lt;SEP&gt;"The French fort commander at Phai Khắt; he rode back to the fort with a few soldiers but was not present when the assault occurred."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7418e6f1b899c505272caee02f3cf1ff</data>
    </node>
