    <node id="&quot;ĐỒN PHAI KHẮT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A French fort at Phai Khăt village in Tam Kim commune, Nguyên Bình district, Cao Bằng province; attacked by Viet Nam Tuyên truyền Giải phóng quân on 25 December 1944; commanded by French fort commander Simono; garrison about 20 soldiers."&lt;SEP&gt;"French fort at Phai Khắt attacked by Việt Nam Tuyên truyền Giải phóng quân on December 25, 1944; central to the Phai Khắt engagement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The French fort at Phai Khắt that was attacked by Việt Minh forces on December 25, 1944; central to the Phai Khắt battle."&lt;SEP&gt;"Đồn Phai Khắ t is the French outpost at Phai Khắt; described as having about 20 French soldiers under a French fort commander (Simono) before being attacked.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7418e6f1b899c505272caee02f3cf1ff</data>
