    <node id="&quot;ĐỒN NÀ NGẦN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A French fort at Nà Ngần, about 25 km from Phai Khăt; garrison of 22 French soldiers under two French officers; attacked on 26 December 1944; four killed and rest captured."&lt;SEP&gt;"French fort at Nà Ngần defended by 22 red-uniform soldiers under two French officers; site of the December 26, 1944 action; approximately 25 km from Phai Khắt."&lt;SEP&gt;"The French fort at Nà Ngần, garrisoned by 22 red-uniform soldiers under two French officers, not all of whom were present during the attack described in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Đồn Nà Ngần is the French outpost at Nà Ngần, attacked the following morning; it had about 22 French troops commanded by two French officers.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7418e6f1b899c505272caee02f3cf1ff</data>
    </node>
