      <data key="d1">"Location of the Nà Ngần fort, approximately 25 kilometers from Phai Khắt, where the second battle took place on December 26, 1944."&lt;SEP&gt;"Location of the Nà Ngần fort, near Phai Khắt, where the second battle occurred in December 1944."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nà Ngần is the location of the second French outpost attacked by Viet Minh forces; located about 25 km from Phai Khắt.&lt;SEP&gt;"Nà Ngần is a fort located about 25 km from Phai Khắt in Nguyên Bình district; on 26 December 1944 it was attacked by Viet Minh forces, with 4 defenders killed and the rest captured, and later Viet Minh secured weapons."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7418e6f1b899c505272caee02f3cf1ff</data>
