      <data key="d1">"A Vietnamese province referenced in a famous song by Tân Huyền."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Vietnamese province where the Xô Viết Nghệ Tĩnh movement originated and where multiple counties formed the initial soviet governance structures."&lt;SEP&gt;"A central Vietnamese province that served as a base for revolutionary activity and the Nghệ Tĩnh Soviet movement.&lt;SEP&gt;"A historical region in Vietnam associated with the Xô Viết Nghệ Tĩnh movement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nghệ An Province, central Vietnam; a site of the Xô Viết Nghệ – Tĩnh uprising."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nghệ An is a Vietnamese province in North Central Vietnam and serves as the geographical setting for many of the revolutionary sites and events described in this text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nghệ An is a Vietnamese province mentioned as the geographic setting for a network of revolutionary sites and events related to the Xô Viết Nghệ Tĩnh movement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nghệ An is a central-north Vietnamese province that served as the main base and geographic setting for the Xô Viết Nghệ Tĩnh movement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nghệ An is the province associated with Nguyễn Ái Quốc and the Nam Đàn locality mentioned in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nghệ An province in Vietnam; referenced as the setting/subject area for the song Tiếng hò trên đất Nghệ An."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nghệ Tĩnh is a Vietnamese province/dialect region; Hồ Chí Minh uses its dialect when addressing the crowd."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nghệ Tĩnh is a historical region in central Vietnam referenced as the origin and setting for the Xô Viết Nghệ Tĩnh movement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nghệ Tĩnh region in central Vietnam; referenced in connection to Xô viết Nghệ Tĩnh as part of the revolutionary movement."</data>
