      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A northern Vietnamese city where Vietnamese and Japanese forces clashed during the struggle, illustrating the theater of combat."&lt;SEP&gt;"Northern Vietnamese city where Việt Minh units attacked Japanese forces during the uprising."&lt;SEP&gt;"Thái Nguyên, northern Vietnam region referenced in the violent suppression context."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a3f9c5b331f58bfebf51e7a9e8de7972&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fff36ca9411ec2bf48b0a366dd7589f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bfa206adeee22a1ede2ef2ae0ad9711</data>
    </node>
