      <data key="d2">chunk-dae09351baefd2c96da656733c534ccd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;QUÂN GIẢI PHÓNG&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Quân Giải phóng (People's Liberation Army) is referenced as part of the security and ceremonial arrangements surrounding the abdication and public events in Hanoi."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-dae09351baefd2c96da656733c534ccd</data>
    </node>
