      <data key="d1">"Date of the Nà Ngần assault, the second phase of the December 25–26, 1944 operation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Date of the independence ceremony at Ba Đình Square in Hanoi."&lt;SEP&gt;"Date of the public independence ceremonies and announcements, marking Vietnam's transition toward sovereignty."&lt;SEP&gt;"Date on which the Phai Khắt assault began, forming the first phase of the December 25–26, 1944 Viet Minh operation against French outposts."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date when the Nam Kỳ uprising began, following the dissemination of the lệnh khởi nghĩa and widespread actions."</data>
