      <data key="d3">130.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Ho Chi Minh served as the president/leader of DRV and governed the North."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ho Chi Minh served as the president/leader of the DPRVN."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hồ Chí Minh is a central figure associated with North Vietnam's leadership and Communist movement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hồ Chí Minh is the President/lead figure of the Provisional Government that proclaims the independence of Vietnam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hồ Chí Minh led the DRV in the struggle for independence."|&gt;"leadership, independence movement"&lt;SEP&gt;"Hồ Chí Minh led the Vietnamese independence movement and served in its governance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hồ Chí Minh led the revolution that led to the creation of the DRV."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hồ Chí Minh là lãnh tụ của Việt Minh và lãnh đạo tuyên ngôn độc lập cho VNDCCH."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hồ Chí Minh proclaimed and led the establishment of the Democratic Republic of Vietnam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hồ Chí Minh remained committed to independence even as the country split again during conflict."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hồ Chí Minh served as president/leader of the VNDCCH, directing governance in the North."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hồ Chí Minh was the leader and President of the DRV, driving its policies and governance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hồ Chí Minh was the leader of North Vietnam and a central figure of the Việt Minh."||"leadership"&lt;SEP&gt;"Hồ Chí Minh was the leader of the North Vietnamese state and the Communist movement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Led the movement that established the DRV and guided Vietnam's path to independence and unification."</data>
