    <edge source="&quot;NHÀ HÁN&quot;" target="&quot;THỜI KỲ BẮC THUỘC LẦN THỨ BA&quot;">
      <data key="d3">70.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Giai đoạn Bắc thuộc lần đầu tiên diễn ra dưới quyền lực của Nhà Hán, đặt nền tảng cho các mối quan hệ giữa hai nền văn hóa."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Bắc thuộc period encompasses Han rule and broader Chinese imperial influence in the region.&lt;SEP&gt;"The Han Dynasty established direct administrative control over Nam Việt and neighboring regions during the first period of Chinese rule; integrated territories and imposed governance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Han campaigns initiated and sustained Bắc thuộc domination."&lt;&lt;|"conquest, domination"&gt;&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Han dynasty invaded and established rule in northern Vietnam, initiating the first Bắc thuộc period."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Han dynasty's campaigns and policies initiated and sustained the Bắc thuộc domination over Vietnamese lands."&lt;SEP&gt;"The first period of Han domination established Han governance over Nam Việt."&lt;SEP&gt;"The second Han domination continued governance over Nam Việt and its surrounding regions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The second period of Han domination continued Han governance and assimilation efforts."</data>
      <data key="d5">"Han rule, geographic influence"&lt;SEP&gt;"conquest, domination"&lt;SEP&gt;"conquest, governance"&lt;SEP&gt;"historical context"&lt;SEP&gt;"invasion, occupation, governance"&lt;SEP&gt;"period, governance"&lt;SEP&gt;"political control, imperial administration"&lt;SEP&gt;8</data>
